From e3878df4d053418d7f186989a8c09e2bead27d79 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arthur Souza Rodrigues <arthursrodrigues@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 21:03:17 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] feat(cli): inspect, text, edit, convert --png/--report,
 capabilities

- jubarte inspect FILE [--json]: paragraph ids, style, flags, limitations,
  package facts, source SHA-256.
- jubarte text FILE: Markdown with [body:p:N] ids (the reading tool).
- jubarte edit FILE --plan P --out-dir D [--dry-run|--force] [--pdf] [--png
  --dpi N]: clean.docx, redline.docx, report.jsonl (load/op/render/save/
  summary events), optional PDFs and PNG pages; a refused plan prints its
  per-operation report and exits 3 without writing.
- jubarte convert: --pdf/--png/--dpi/--report from one layout pass;
  default remains PDF.
- jubarte capabilities --json: manifest derived from the build.
- capabilities module in the library so Python reports the same manifest.
- clippy 1.95 -D warnings clean, including two pre-existing sites
  (altchunk end(), shape stroke boolean) that the newer lint set flagged.

